hot zikh gekent aynhaltn oyf an arbet

00:24:06.769 --> 00:24:09.821
un di, WHY? BECAUSE EH

00:24:09.928 --> 00:24:15.271
oyb er iz geven a guter dokter, az m'hot gevolt makhn a SURGERY, LET'S SAY LIKE THIS

00:24:15.362 --> 00:24:17.026
hostu gemuzt epes batsoln

00:24:17.607 --> 00:24:21.499
az nisht hot men gemakht di SURGERY on der UNK iz geven tsores nokh der SURGERY

00:24:22.078 --> 00:24:23.506
flegn zey makhn gelt.

00:24:24.137 --> 00:24:26.156
iz, nu, un zey flegn oykh tsoln

00:24:26.365 --> 00:24:28.232
zey flegn tsoln zeyere balebatim

00:24:28.558 --> 00:24:30.999
azoy ot hot men eyns dos andere geshlept.

00:24:32.490 --> 00:24:34.807
BUT OFFICIAL iz gevezn, m'hot, m'hot undz

00:24:34.807 --> 00:24:37.074
shtark, shtark faynt gehat. m'hot undz

00:24:38.835 --> 00:24:41.512
i mekane fun eyn zayt zenen zey undz mekane

00:24:41.518 --> 00:24:42.541
gevezn

00:24:42.632 --> 00:24:46.456
s'iz gevezn a mol, se kumt oys UNK ker mikh um a bisele

00:24:46.497 --> 00:24:49.354
ven mir ze'mir nor gekumen keyn LVOV

00:24:49.354 --> 00:24:55.687
m'hot gevoynt bay a rus, bay a rusishn, nisht keyn, dortn vos, a ukrayner, a rusisher

00:24:55.812 --> 00:24:57.240
shtark a voyler goy

00:24:57.634 --> 00:25:00.896
un er iz geven shtark voyl far, far di kinder un far mh

00:25:00.896 --> 00:25:04.243
kh'hob keyn mol nisht gehert fun im keyn shlekht vort. er iz geven a shiker a groyser.

00:25:04.806 --> 00:25:07.719
er hot gearbet in a mh

00:25:08.603 --> 00:25:09.744
LIKE A

00:25:09.852 --> 00:25:11.736
A PROFESSIONAL HIGH SCHOOL

00:25:12.130 --> 00:25:13.896
un me fleg gibn a gute SALARY

00:25:15.724 --> 00:25:19.824
un se fleg im tomed nisht, tomed nisht stayen tsu der, tsu der, tsu der ander SALARY

00:25:19.824 --> 00:25:21.564
zi hot oykh gearbet, di vayb.

00:25:21.564 --> 00:25:24.746
di kinder hot mayn vayb shoyn akhtung gegebn oyf, oyf di kinder

00:25:25.950 --> 00:25:27.952
⟨nor⟩ er fleg kumen ale tog shiker.

00:25:28.347 --> 00:25:30.366
zi hot, mir ho'mir zikh eyn mol tseredt

00:25:30.557 --> 00:25:32.660
in der heym, zitsndik baym tish

00:25:32.869 --> 00:25:35.431
zogt er, "ikh ken nisht farshteyn. du fardinst

00:25:35.431 --> 00:25:36.778
akhtsik rubl

00:25:38.033 --> 00:25:41.604
un azoy az bay dir iz tomed do a shtikele broyt in shtub

00:25:41.745 --> 00:25:44.321
un s'iz tomed do bay dir a shtikele fleysh

00:25:46.200 --> 00:25:48.337
un di bist nisht naket un nisht borves"

00:25:48.681 --> 00:25:52.691
un er iz gan ongeton in di, vos er iz geven in di MILITARY

00:25:52.900 --> 00:25:54.362
dos iz er gan ongeton.

00:25:57.253 --> 00:26:02.893
kh'hob nisht gevolt im entfern azoy grob, nor kh'hob nisht gehat keyn ander oysveg UNK hobn

00:26:03.042 --> 00:26:06.107
"lomikh hern." "vifl mol hostu mikh gezen shiker?"

00:26:08.307 --> 00:26:09.718
zogt er "keyn eyn mol nisht."

00:26:10.264 --> 00:26:11.608
"un ikh dikh

00:26:12.070 --> 00:26:13.678
kimat ale tog

00:26:13.678 --> 00:26:16.353
darf ikh dikh nemen fun der tir baym hentele

00:26:16.353 --> 00:26:17.801
un dikh tsufirn tsum bet.

00:26:18.972 --> 00:26:19.928
THAT'S IT.

00:26:20.018 --> 00:26:21.193
THIS IS THE ANSWER."

00:26:23.207 --> 00:26:26.542
kh'hob im nor gedarft tsoln d- draysik rubl far, far RENT.

00:26:30.261 --> 00:26:32.432
s'iz gevezn nisht gring.

00:26:33.315 --> 00:26:34.777
gevezn nisht gring.

00:26:35.695 --> 00:26:41.004
iz geven, m'hot, ikh hob gedarft a sakh, ikh UNK mayn vayb hobn mir gedarft a sakh

00:26:41.280 --> 00:26:43.839
shteln dem kop, UNK shteln dem haldz

00:26:43.997 --> 00:26:45.594
oyf tsu tun epes

00:26:45.735 --> 00:26:47.096
oyf tsu fardinen

00:26:48.182 --> 00:26:50.538
oyf tsu hodeven di kinder, oyf ontsutun

00:26:50.781 --> 00:26:52.378
zey gebn epes a COLLEGE

00:26:52.435 --> 00:26:56.496
un s- hob ikh gedarft gibn, UNK mayn zun hot gedarft arayn in COLLEGE, hob ikh gedarft batsoln.

00:26:56.974 --> 00:26:58.571
hot men nisht, FORGET IT.

00:26:59.472 --> 00:27:00.546
ikh hob batsolt.

00:27:00.788 --> 00:27:05.220
un er iz arayn ⟨un geendikt⟩ dem COLLEGE, un er iz aroys, UNK hot gehat nayntsik rubl.

00:27:06.610 --> 00:27:08.544
nor di zelbe vos ikh on a COLLEGE.

00:27:08.989 --> 00:27:09.742
SEE?

00:27:11.537 --> 00:27:15.412
un vi azoy iz geven in shtub az ir hot gehat

00:27:15.722 --> 00:27:24.373
bazundere keylim in shtub? UNK tsi, tsi ir hot gehat nit tsi ir hot gehat, s'iz geven treyfene fleysh tsi koshere fleysh?

00:27:24.615 --> 00:27:27.123
vi iz geven bay aykh in shtub?

00:27:25.830 --> 00:27:31.291
NO, NO, s'iz gevezn, I WOULD SAY iz geven di zelb- zelbe

00:27:31.753 --> 00:27:34.025
alts oyf eyn, eyn keylim?

00:27:32.935 --> 00:27:35.055
eyn, yo, yo, eyn keyle.

00:27:36.715 --> 00:27:38.390
un di ki-

00:27:36.732 --> 00:27:41.501
mir ho'mir poshet, s'iz poshet nisht arayngekumen keyn treyfe zakh in shtub.

00:27:42.840 --> 00:27:46.344
nisht arayngekumen keyn khazer. s'iz nisht arayngekumen keyn

00:27:46.553 --> 00:27:49.331
fun khazer zakhn

00:27:49.506 --> 00:27:50.225
NO.

00:27:50.535 --> 00:27:57.800
mayn froy fleg koyfn hiner, lebedike hiner un UNK geyn tsum shoykhet un koyln un UNK.

00:27:58.737 --> 00:28:00.165
un ir hot gehat

00:27:58.905 --> 00:28:03.404
un zi fleg yo- yontev flegn mir, yontoyvim flegn mir, di yidishe yontoyvim flegn mir haltn

00:28:04.137 --> 00:28:05.559
⟨tsu⟩ mayn vayb BECAUSE

00:28:05.559 --> 00:28:06.779
zi hot gevust

00:28:07.090 --> 00:28:08.434
ale di zakhn

00:28:08.592 --> 00:28:11.269
iz yontoyvim flegn mir haltn. vifl s'iz geven a shul

00:28:11.275 --> 00:28:12.703
flegn mir geyn in shul.

00:28:13.182 --> 00:28:14.866
ikh ken nisht davenen, nor

00:28:14.866 --> 00:28:16.500
ile mentshn zikh tsunoyfkumen.

00:28:16.759 --> 00:28:18.845
dernokh dem hot men

00:28:19.408 --> 00:28:20.769
a min a fuftsn

00:28:21.349 --> 00:28:23.351
efsher merert fuftsn yor

00:28:23.526 --> 00:28:25.055
hot men farmakht di shul.

00:28:25.770 --> 00:28:27.569
in velkhn yor iz dos geven?

00:28:28.116 --> 00:28:31.130
mh, zol ikh nisht zogn keyn lign

00:28:31.761 --> 00:28:34.348
ergets AROUND SIXTY EIGHT

00:28:34.348 --> 00:28:36.345
MAYBE BEFORE, MAYBE AFTER.

